    "name": "BREADSKATE",
    "steam_appid": 1677720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/404b602578c0f531a7fd3d59804823a5.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.mp4?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of skating like never before by becoming the bread! Breadskate transforms traditional platforming into a delightful, physics-driven adventure. Perform flips, grinds, and aerial stunts across diverse skateparks. Master the dynamic trick system to chain combos and earn high scores, all while navigating a world where agility and creativity are your best assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/a7be678778fd6cc902ffcf974262de40.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/25521056a8b0fd9327be55c8c11e76d2.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/25521056a8b0fd9327be55c8c11e76d2.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bread, your rules. Tailor your bread's look and feel as you dive into a comprehensive customization system where you can modify your breadskate's appearance and performance. Adjust speed, jump height, boost power, and spin rate to match your playstyle. Collect resources through challenges to bake new bread types, trucks, and wheels, ensuring your loaf stands out in both looks and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/3d2f1e3fdb1df99ebfff3363abc316c5.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.mp4?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Breadskate is under siege by rival duck skaters who are looking to rule the ramps. Embark on a journey through three distinct locations, each teeming with skateparks, hidden secrets, and formidable duck opponents. Complete challenges, explore every nook and cranny, and gear up to confront these feathered foes. Only by shredding harder than them can you hope to toast these invaders and restore peace to your yeasty world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/404b602578c0f531a7fd3d59804823a5.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/1ca1783e06c23295776aa6ffd10baf29.mp4?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of skating like never before by becoming the bread! Breadskate transforms traditional platforming into a delightful, physics-driven adventure. Perform flips, grinds, and aerial stunts across diverse skateparks. Master the dynamic trick system to chain combos and earn high scores, all while navigating a world where agility and creativity are your best assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/a7be678778fd6cc902ffcf974262de40.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/25521056a8b0fd9327be55c8c11e76d2.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/25521056a8b0fd9327be55c8c11e76d2.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your bread, your rules. Tailor your bread's look and feel as you dive into a comprehensive customization system where you can modify your breadskate's appearance and performance. Adjust speed, jump height, boost power, and spin rate to match your playstyle. Collect resources through challenges to bake new bread types, trucks, and wheels, ensuring your loaf stands out in both looks and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/3d2f1e3fdb1df99ebfff3363abc316c5.avif?t=1748730076\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.poster.avif?t=1748730076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.webm?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677720/extras/8a0997e940fbaa217c231b7c0838617a.mp4?t=1748730076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Breadskate is under siege by rival duck skaters who are looking to rule the ramps. Embark on a journey through three distinct locations, each teeming with skateparks, hidden secrets, and formidable duck opponents. Complete challenges, explore every nook and cranny, and gear up to confront these feathered foes. Only by shredding harder than them can you hope to toast these invaders and restore peace to your yeasty world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Roll, flip, and toast your way through a whimsical world in BREADSKATE a freeroam skating game! As a sentient loaf on wheels, master dynamic skating tricks, rebake the bread to your liking, customizing appearance and handling, and face off against skating duck rivals in a quest to save your world.",
